WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.278 --> 00:00:08.951
The birth of a baby is usually a joyous occasion. It certainly was for the king and

2
00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:16.353
queen of England one day in the sixteenth century. When their son was born, the entire

3
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:23.938
country celebrated with feasts and jubilant dancing and singing. From the moment Edward, the Prince of Wales,

4
