to Tom. Then he led him to his private chambers in the palace. "What is your name?"

45
00:05:19.132 --> 00:05:26.622
asked Edward. "Tom Canty," Tom replied. Quickly he added, "Sir&#8212;I mean, Your Highness!" "Where do you reside,

