Tom Canty?" Tom noticed that Edward was rolling something like a large coin around in his

47
00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:41.352
hand. "Offal Court," Tom said. Then, for the next few minutes, Tom answered questions about his family.

48
00:05:41.353 --> 00:05:45.357
When Edward heard about John Canty, the prince nodded knowingly. "I believe our fathers are alike.

49
00:05:45.358 --> 00:05:51.022
Mine does not hit me, but his tongue can be cruel." "My mother is good to me,"

50
